    "marriage.locational.jasper.town.a": "Good day my love.$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.town.b": "I hope you are having a glorious day.$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.town.c": "Good day my love.$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.town.d": "I hope you are having a glorious day.$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.beach.a": "Shall we dabble our toes in the water, my love?$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.beach.b": "Hello my love, care to join me for some beachcombing?$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.beach.c": "I do love the smell of the ocean air.$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.beach.d": "Shall we build a sandcastle, beloved?$l$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.forest.a": "Can you hear them, my love? The creatures in the trees? The forest is truly alive.$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.forest.b": "Can you hear them, my love? The creatures in the trees? The forest is truly alive.$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.forest.c": "Can you hear them, my love? The creatures in the trees? The forest is truly alive.$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.forest.d": "Can you hear them, my love? The creatures in the trees? The forest is truly alive.$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mountain.a": "There's nothing quite like this fresh mountain air, is there beloved?$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mountain.b": "Phew, the walk is quite exhausting, perhaps I should take a short rest.$2$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mountain.c": "There's nothing quite like this fresh mountain air, is there beloved?$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mountain.d": "There's nothing quite like this fresh mountain air, is there beloved?$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mine.a": "Oh Beloved, I still am not too fond of the dark and the embrace of the earth.$2$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mine.b": "Oh Beloved, I still am not too fond of the dark and the embrace of the earth.$2$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mine.c": "Oh Beloved, I still am not too fond of the dark and the embrace of the earth.$2$k",
    "marriage.locational.jasper.mine.d": "Oh Beloved, I still am not too fond of the dark and the embrace of the earth.$2$k"
}